OL,4,BHolloway sacked by Swindon after two   
OL,5,Bseasons                                
OL,6,GManager Ian Holloway has been sacked   
OL,7,Gby Swindon Town after just over two    
OL,8,Gyears in charge.                       
OL,10,FThe Robins' 2-0 loss at Newport County 
OL,11,Fon Saturday left them 17th in League   
OL,12,FTwo and was their fourth successive    
OL,13,Fdefeat in all competitions - conceding 
OL,14,F10 goals in the process.               
OL,16,FThey have won only two of their past   
OL,17,F15 matches, and Holloway last month    
OL,18,Fdescribed himself as a "dead man       
OL,19,Fwalking" if Swindon's form did not     
OL,20,Fturn around.                           
